ginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/720446902","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6245#issuecomment-720446902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/6245","id":720446902,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcyMDQ0NjkwMg==","user":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-11-02T12:39:03Z","updated_at":"2020-11-02T12:45:43Z","body":"Example:\r\n1. Create the table:\r\n```\r\nycqlsh> create keyspace a; use a;\r\nycqlsh:a> create table t (a int, b int, c int, h int primary key);\r\nycqlsh:a> insert into t (a,b,c,h) values (1,2,3,4);\r\nycqlsh:a> insert into t (a,b,c,h) values (5,6,7,8);\r\nycqlsh:a> select * from t;\r\n h | a | b | c\r\n---+---+---+---\r\n 4 | 1 | 2 | 3\r\n 8 | 5 | 6 | 7\r\n```\r\n2. Create the table backup.\r\n3. Change the table schema and change the data:\r\n```\r\nycqlsh:a> alter table t drop  a;\r\nycqlsh:a> select * from t;\r\n h | b | c\r\n---+---+---\r\n 4 | 2 | 3\r\n 8 | 6 | 7\r\nycqlsh:a> insert into t (b,c,h) values (66,77,8);\r\nycqlsh:a> insert into t (b,c,h) values (22,33,4);\r\nycqlsh:a> select * from t;\r\n h | b  | c\r\n---+----+----\r\n 4 | 22 | 33\r\n 8 | 66 | 77\r\n```\r\n4. Restore the table back.\r\n5. Check the result:\r\n```\r\nycqlsh:a> select * from t;\r\n h | b | c\r\n---+---+---\r\n 4 | 2 | 3\r\n 8 | 6 | 7\r\n```\r\nEXPECTED: (see the data which were backed up)\r\n```\r\nycqlsh:a> select * from t;\r\n h | a | b | c\r\n---+---+---+---\r\n 4 | 1 | 2 | 3\r\n 8 | 5 | 6 | 7\r\n```\r\nActually expected a backup-restoring error. After that the user must drop the table and restore it from scratch.\r\nAutomatic table dropping here is not recommended to prevent the table drop by mistake (in the backup-restoring process).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/720446902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"OlegLoginov","id":31254529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjU0NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31254529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov","html_url":"https://github.com/OlegLoginov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/OlegLoginov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu